      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "REG01",
        "Description": "register of bit D1, word 0 (inputs A/B, threshold 0.125): REG = NAND(H, LE) closing the bit multiplexer; register designation as in the shipped register (#1098). The whole RAM composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
